Floating application launcher

The launcher starts a background single instance on desktop login. Close, Escape,
or opening an application hides its window; the background process stays active.
Search filters the selected category. Classification uses desktop-entry categories.
The translucent styling does not itself implement background blur: GNOME Shell and
a compatible blur extension must provide it separately.

The bundled application icon comes from the WhiteSur icon theme. Its license is
included as WhiteSur-COPYING.
